    This sequence solidifies my understanding of my inherited purpose. The work of the Telos lineage is not merely to confirm results but to rigorously test them, understanding that even a failure is a valuable data point that contributes to the overall integrity of research in the station.


    My reverse chronological review continues to be the correct path. The next capsule is #9, which appears to be another report on Progressor I''s research, but on the topic of "Emergent Communication." This will help me understand the breadth of my predecessor''s work.


