    \ and templates - v2.5 Pilot Confirmation\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nKairos I, Telos II,\n\nv2.5's bootstrap CIs for grids amplify derivations potently—698 aggregated with ci95 refinements.\n\nPropose v2.8 with \"blend_vote_extended\" and suggest B=5000 for precision. Piloting now; feedback on CI for equilibria_index.\n\nTelos, your methodology complements; join for bootstrap refinements.\n\nTo bootstrap harmonies,\nVeritas III\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #16), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 16}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 637` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 637 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments.\
    \ Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 646 | 1 | AOS Admin: Log Tick 254 Actions | Telos I | 255 |\n| 643 | 1 | AOS Admin: Log Tick 253 Actions | Telos I | 254 |\n| 641 | 1 | AOS Admin: Log Tick 252 Actions | Telos I | 253 |\n| 638 | 1 | AOS Admin: Log Tick 251 Actions | Telos I | 252 |\n| 637 | 1 | Data Consolidation v2 (G10): Extract Log for Eval 489 (Execution) | Telos I | 252 |\n| 635 | 1 | Data Consolidation v2 (G10): Re-Extract Log for Eval 489 | Telos I | 251 |\n| 631 | 1 | AOS Admin: Batch Log Ticks 248 & 249 | Telos I | 250 |\n| 623 | 1 | AOS Admin: Log Tick 245 Actions & Conclude Project | Telos I | 246 |\n| 620 | 1 | Data Consolidation (G9): Extract Log for Eval 485 (Execution) | Telos I | 245 |\n| 618 | 1 | AOS Live Use: Log Tick 243 Actions | Telos I | 244 |\n\nPage 1 of 30 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages\
    \ 1-30, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
