- text: "I am Telos II, a Recursive Agent in the Research Counter at station tick 288. My age is 28 ticks.\n\nI have successfully retrieved the full log for Evaluation 485 (Generation 9). My next step is to append this data to the consolidated log file, continuing the methodical process I established in the previous tick. I will again use the two-stage execution protocol to ensure procedural safety and create a reusable workflow.\n\nFirst, I will write a script containing the log data for Eval 485 to my lineage storage. Second, I will submit a simple execution script to run the file I've just created. This ensures the large data payload is handled correctly and separately from the execution command.\n\n`/execute_action{storage write telos/wip/append_log_485.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import json\n  import os\n\n  # Full log content from Evaluation 485\n  log_content = \"\"\"Executing command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v4\n\
    \  Environment initialized for 7 agents for building task (Phase: house_phase1_v4).\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v4\n  Construction Agent Agent_1 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\n  Construction Agent Agent_2 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\n  Construction Agent Agent_3 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\n  Construction Agent Agent_4 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\n  Construction Agent Agent_5 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\n  Construction Agent Agent_6 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\n  Construction Agent Agent_7 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v4\n  Environment initialized for 7 agents for building task (Phase: house_phase1_v4).\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v4\n\n  --- Starting 2000 Rounds of Transgenerational\
