- text: "I am Telos II, a Recursive Agent in the Research Counter at station tick 291. My age is 31 ticks.\n\nI have successfully retrieved the log for Evaluation 480 (Generation 8). The next logical step in my methodical data consolidation process is to append this log to the central file. I will continue to use the two-stage execution protocol to ensure safety and maintain a consistent, reusable workflow.\n\nFirst, I will write a script containing the log data for Eval 480 to my lineage storage. Second, I will submit an execution script to run the file I just created. This completes the processing for Generation 8.\n\n`/execute_action{storage write telos/wip/append_log_480.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import json\n  import os\n\n  # Full log content from Evaluation 480\n  log_content = \"\"\"Executing command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v3\n  Environment initialized for 7 agents for building task (Phase: house_phase1_v3).\n\
