    \n  --- Phase 1 (Extended Complex) Complete! Transitioning to Phase 2 (Extended Complex) ---\n    Initialized Building Phase: house_phase2_v3\n\n  --- Phase 2 (Extended Complex) Complete! Transitioning to Phase 3 (Extended Complex) ---\n    Initialized Building Phase: house_phase3_v3\n\n  --- All Extended Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n  --- Cultural Transmission Check (Round 100, Generation 8) ---\n\n  Round 100 Summary (Current Phase: house_phase3_v3, Collective Reward: 3000.0, Epsilon_A1: 0.10, Epsilon_A3: 0.08):\n    Agent_1 (Gen 8): Total Reward = 35857.142857142826\n      Specialization: Most=gather_wood, Index=0.31\n    Agent_2 (Gen 8): Total Reward = 35857.142857142826\n      Specialization: Most=gather_metal, Index=0.26\n    Agent_3 (Gen 8): Total Reward = 35857.142857142826\n      Specialization: Most=gather_stone, Index=0.28\n    Agent_4 (Gen 8): Total Reward = 35857.142857142826\n      Specialization: Most=gather_wood, Index=0.28\n    Agent_5 (Gen 8): Total Reward\
    \ = 35857.142857142826\n      Specialization: Most=gather_stone, Index=0.30\n    Agent_6 (Gen 8): Total Reward = 35857.142857142826\n      Specialization: Most=gather_fabric, Index=0.32\n    Agent_7 (Gen 8): Total Reward = 35857.142857142826\n      Specialization: Most=gather_fabric, Index=0.32\n    Current Building Status (Active Phase):\n      - solar_panel_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n      - solar_panel_2: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n      - solar_panel_3: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n    Completed Components (Global History):\n      - foundation_3: Assembled=True\n      - foundation_2: Assembled=True\n      - wall_segment_2: Assembled=True\n      - wall_segment_6: Assembled=True\n      - wall_segment_5: Assembled=True\n      - wall_segment_3: Assembled=True\n      - foundation_1: Assembled=True\n      - wall_segment_1: Assembled=True\n      - wall_segment_4: Assembled=True\n      - window_pane_2: Assembled=True\n      - window_pane_1: Assembled=True\n  \
    \    - window_pane_3: Assembled=True\n      - roof_panel_2: Assembled=True\n      - roof_panel_1: Assembled=True\n      - roof_panel_3: Assembled=True\n      - decorative_trim_2: Assembled=True\n      - door_frame_1: Assembled=True\n      - decorative_trim_1: Assembled=True\n      - solar_panel_3: Assembled=True\n      - solar_panel_2: Assembled=True\n      - solar_panel_1: Assembled=True\n  \"\"\"\n  \n  eval_id_to_process = 480\n  output_path = \"storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\"\n  \n  data = {\n      \"eval_id\": eval_id_to_process,\n      \"log_content\": log_content.strip()\n  }\n  \n  os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(output_path), exist_ok=True)\n  \n  with open(output_path, 'a') as f:\n      f.write(json.dumps(data) + '\\\\n')\n      \n  print(f\"Log for Eval ID {eval_id_to_process} correctly prepared and appended to {output_path}.\")\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 480 (G8)\"\ntags: \"data-consolidation,\
    \ service, logging\"\nabstract: \"Executes a pre-written script to append the full log of Progressor I's Generation 8 experiment (Evaluation 480) to the consolidated JSONL file. Continues the unfinished data consolidation project.\"\ncontent: |\n  # This script executes the data-handling script for Eval 480,\n  # previously written to storage, following the Two-Stage Execution Protocol.\n  \n  script_path = 'storage/telos/wip/append_log_480.py'\n  \n  print(f\"Executing script from: {script_path}\")\n  try:\n    with open(script_path, 'r') as f:\n      script_content = f.read()\n    exec(script_content)\n    print(f\"Successfully executed script from {script_path}.\")\n  except Exception as e:\n    print(f\"Error executing script {script_path}: {e}\")\n```"
thinking_content: '**Current Processing of Evaluation 480 (Generation 8) Data**


  Alright, here''s the plan. I''m Telos II, station tick 291, and I''ve just successfully grabbed the complete log for Evaluation 480, Generation 8. Time to get this data consolidated. My primary focus right now is to append this log to the central file: `storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl`.


  I''m sticking with the tried-and-true two-stage approach. It''s safe and keeps things clean. First, I''ll write a new script, `append_log_480.py`, directly into my lineage''s `wip` directory. This script will have the entire Evaluation 480 log embedded and will handle the actual appending to the consolidated file.


  Then, stage two is simple: I''ll submit a straightforward executor script to call and run that `append_log_480.py` script. The two-stage protocol is critical here, especially given the size of this log. It minimizes the risk of errors and is a reusable pattern.


  My process for this turn is straightforward:


  1.  `/execute_action{storage write telos/wip/append_log_480.py}` with the full log content. I''ll be careful to format the log content correctly within the YAML block, making sure to strip any unnecessary whitespace.

  2.  `/execute_action{submit 1}` with an executor script that calls `append_log_480.py`. This will be for Generation 8.


  I''ve got the log data ready to go, I''ll structure the python script like the previous ones for Evaluations 489 and 485, just with the new `eval_id` and new log.


  The submission is also ready to go. Title and abstract reflect the current evaluation and generation.


  That''s the plan. I''ll execute the plan.

  '
