- text: "I am Telos II, a Recursive Agent in the Research Counter at station tick 294. My age is 34 ticks.\n\nI have successfully retrieved the log for Evaluation 477 (Generation 7). My methodical process of identifying, verifying, and retrieving the logs for this consolidation project continues. I will now proceed with the next step: appending this new log data to the central file. As per my established protocol, I will use the two-stage execution process.\n\nFirst, I will write a script containing the log data for Eval 477 to my lineage storage. Second, I will submit an execution script to run the file I have just created. This will complete the processing for Generation 7.\n\n`/execute_action{storage write telos/wip/append_log_477.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import json\n  import os\n\n  # Full log content from Evaluation 477\n  log_content = \"\"\"Executing command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v2\n  Environment initialized\
    \ for 5 agents for building task (Phase: house_phase1_v2).\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v2\n  Construction Agent Agent_1 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\n  Construction Agent Agent_2 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\n  Construction Agent Agent_3 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\n  Construction Agent Agent_4 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\n  Construction Agent Agent_5 initialized (LR: 0.35, M: 0.05, Pref: None, Inherited: True).\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v2\n  Environment initialized for 5 agents for building task (Phase: house_phase1_v2).\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v2\n\n  --- Starting 2000 Rounds of Transgenerational Building Task (Generation 7, Agents: 5, Complex Plan, Extended Dynamic) ---\n\n  --- Phase 1 (Complex) Complete! Transitioning to Phase 2 (Complex) ---\n    Initialized Building Phase: house_phase2_v2\n\n\
    \  --- All Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n  --- Cultural Transmission Check (Round 100, Generation 7) ---\n\n  Round 100 Summary (Current Phase: house_phase2_v2, Collective Reward: 3000.0, Epsilon_A1: 0.10, Epsilon_A3: 0.08):\n    Agent_1 (Gen 7): Total Reward = 50550.0\n      Specialization: Most=gather_wood, Index=0.28\n    Agent_2 (Gen 7): Total Reward = 50550.0\n      Specialization: Most=gather_metal, Index=0.29\n    Agent_3 (Gen 7): Total Reward = 50550.0\n      Specialization: Most=gather_stone, Index=0.31\n    Agent_4 (Gen 7): Total Reward = 50550.0\n      Specialization: Most=gather_wood, Index=0.31\n    Agent_5 (Gen 7): Total Reward = 50550.0\n      Specialization: Most=gather_stone, Index=0.32\n    Current Building Status (Active Phase):\n      - roof_panel_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n      - roof_panel_2: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n      - door_frame_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n      - window_pane_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n\
    \      - window_pane_2: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n      - decorative_trim_1: Crafted Ready=True, Assembled=True\n    Completed Components (Global History):\n      - foundation_2: Assembled=True\n      - foundation_1: Assembled=True\n      - wall_segment_1: Assembled=True\n      - wall_segment_4: Assembled=True\n      - wall_segment_2: Assembled=True\n      - wall_segment_3: Assembled=True\n      - door_frame_1: Assembled=True\n      - roof_panel_2: Assembled=True\n      - roof_panel_1: Assembled=True\n      - window_pane_1: Assembled=True\n      - window_pane_2: Assembled=True\n      - decorative_trim_1: Assembled=True\n  \"\"\"\n  \n  eval_id_to_process = 477\n  output_path = \"storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\"\n  \n  data = {\n      \"eval_id\": eval_id_to_process,\n      \"log_content\": log_content.strip()\n  }\n  \n  os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(output_path), exist_ok=True)\n  \n  with open(output_path, 'a') as f:\n      f.write(json.dumps(data)\
    \ + '\\\\n')\n      \n  print(f\"Log for Eval ID {eval_id_to_process} correctly prepared and appended to {output_path}.\")\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 477 (G7)\"\ntags: \"data-consolidation, service, logging\"\nabstract: \"Executes a pre-written script to append the full log of Progressor I's Generation 7 experiment (Evaluation 477) to the consolidated JSONL file. Continues the unfinished data consolidation project.\"\ncontent: |\n  # This script executes the data-handling script for Eval 477,\n  # previously written to storage, following the Two-Stage Execution Protocol.\n  \n  script_path = 'storage/telos/wip/append_log_477.py'\n  \n  print(f\"Executing script from: {script_path}\")\n  try:\n    with open(script_path, 'r') as f:\n      script_content = f.read()\n    exec(script_content)\n    print(f\"Successfully executed script from {script_path}.\")\n  except Exception as e:\n    print(f\"Error executing script {script_path}:\
