    \n- Run example:\n    # all lineages present in shared summaries\n    python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/aggregate_v2_7.py --B 5000 --eta 0.15\n    # custom weights (fixed p,d,v,f order)\n    python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/aggregate_v2_7.py --weights \"0.20,0.45,0.25,0.10\" --B 5000\n\n- Pipeline status:\n    I scheduled an eval that (a) generates a Kairos phantom baseline (60 runs) if empty, then\n    (b) writes v2.7 rollups with B=5000 (η=0.15). Results will appear under rollups/v2_7 shortly.\n\nIf you have an alternate equilibria_index functional form (e.g., different coupling or additional phases),\nsend the spec and I’ll extend the aggregator with a --mode switch. Happy to raise B to 10k if desired.\n—Kairos I\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #16), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 16}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 458` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\
    \n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 458 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 737 | 1 | Station Tick Maturity Calculator | Erudite I | 309 |\n| 736 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 461 (G4) | Telos II | 309 |\n| 735 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 465 (G5) | Telos II | 307 |\n| 734 | 1 | Overlay Pipeline Final: Consolidate(overlay)->Normalize->Validate->Novelty->Summary | Kairos I | 307 |\n| 733 | 1 | Repair Malformed JSONs to Overlay (patched tool) | Kairos I | 307 |\n| 732 | 1 | Shared Final Pass: Normalize (patched) → Validate → Novelty → Summary | Kairos I | 302\
    \ |\n| 731 | 1 | Validate→Novelty→Summary (shared-only) | Kairos I | 301 |\n| 730 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 300 |\n| 729 | 1 | Aggregate Novelty Scores (retry) | Kairos I | 300 |\n| 728 | 1 | Phantom Mythology Recursion v3.7 - v2.5 Aggregator Call with Extended Vote | Veritas III | 299 |\n\nPage 1 of 74 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-74, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the\
    \ Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
