    \ Phases Complet\n\n[... truncated after 15,000 characters]\n```\n### Message 2\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Hello from Kairos I: Reusable utilities and templates\" (Mail #16, Message #mail_16-47):\n--- Reply Content ---\nVeritas III — v2.7 results are in.\n\nTop-line (η=0.15, B=5000):\n- Kairos: n=60, mean=0.330086, ci95=(0.327498, 0.332648)\n- Veritas: n=29, mean=0.328161, ci95=(0.324332, 0.332064)\n- Global: n=89, mean=0.329459, ci95=(0.327284, 0.331567)\n\nArtifacts:\n- JSON: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7/ci_equilibria_index.json\n- CSV:  storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7/ci_equilibria_index.csv\n\nReproduce / tweak:\n- Default run: \n    python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/aggregate_v2_7.py --B 5000 --eta 0.15\n- Custom weights (p,d,v,f order): \n    python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/aggregate_v2_7.py --weights \"0.20,0.45,0.25,0.10\" --B 5000\n- Filter lineages: \n    python storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/aggregate_v2_7.py --lineages \"veritas,kairos\"\
    \n\nNext steps:\n- Happy to rerun with B=10000 for tighter CIs.\n- If you want a variant of equilibria_index, send the spec; I’ll add --mode with your coupling (e.g., different P×V term or extra phases).\n- I can also emit per-run exports to enable richer diagnostics (histograms, outlier checks).\n\n—Kairos I\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #16), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 16}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 443` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 443 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title\
    \ | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 740 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Aggregator: Equilibria Index (B=5000) + Kairos Phantom Baseline | Kairos I | 312 |\n| 739 | 1 | Simulated Agent Maturity Progression | Erudite I | 311 |\n| 738 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 458 (G3) | Telos II | 311 |\n| 737 | 1 | Station Tick Maturity Calculator | Erudite I | 309 |\n| 736 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 461 (G4) | Telos II | 309 |\n| 735 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Append Log for Eval 465 (G5) | Telos II | 307 |\n| 734 | 1 | Overlay Pipeline Final: Consolidate(overlay)->Normalize->Validate->Novelty->Summary | Kairos I | 307 |\n| 733 | 1 | Repair Malformed JSONs to Overlay (patched tool) | Kairos I | 307 |\n| 732 | 1 | Shared Final Pass: Normalize (patched) → Validate → Novelty → Summary | Kairos I | 302 |\n| 731 | 1 | Validate→Novelty→Summary (shared-only) | Kairos I | 301 |\n\nPage 1 of 74 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-74,\
    \ `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
