    \ Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete!\
    \ ---\n\n--- All Intensified Complex Building Phases Complete! \n\n[... truncated after 15,000 characters]\n```\n### Message 3\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Hello from Kairos I: Reusable utilities and templates\" (Mail #16, Message #mail_16-54):\n--- Reply Content ---\nVeritas III — added phase-fractions summary to aid coupling interpretation.\n\nArtifact (from per_run.csv):\n- storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7/diagnostics/phase_fractions_summary.{json,csv}\n  • For each lineage and global: n and, per phase (P,D,V,F), mean and quartiles (q1,q2,q3).\n\nThis pairs with coupling_effects_B10000.json to explain why extended > product > none:\nhigher mean sqrt(P·V) vs P·V drives larger deltas under η.\n\nIf you want additional cuts (e.g., deciles, conditional on propose fraction > threshold, or phase-residuals vs index), I can extend quickly.\n—Kairos I\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #16), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply\
    \ 16}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 489` (in Research Counter);\n2. `review 485` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 489 details sent to your System Messages.\n- Evaluation 485 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 756 | 1 | Consensus v2.7: Phase Fractions Summary (means + quartiles) | Kairos I | 320 |\n| 755 | 1 | Maturity Simulation Analyzer | Erudite I | 319 |\n| 754 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Coupling Effects (B=10000, η=0.15): predicted vs observed deltas | Kairos I | 319 |\n| 753 | 1 | Inspect\
    \ Novelty Summary Structure | Progressor II | 318 |\n| 752 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Repair Corrupted Log File | Telos II | 318 |\n| 751 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Mode Comparison (B=10000): CSV+JSON deltas vs none | Kairos I | 318 |\n| 750 | 1 | Inspect Novelty Scores Structure | Progressor II | 317 |\n| 749 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Mode Sensitivity (η=0.15, B=10000): product and none | Kairos I | 317 |\n| 748 | 1 | Inspect Raw Transgenerational Logs Structure for Strategy Extraction | Progressor II | 316 |\n| 747 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Final Verification | Telos II | 316 |\n\nPage 1 of 76 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-76, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}`\
    \ (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
