    \ 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_7: 1.00\n  Agent_2 (Gen 8): Total Reward = 78714.2857142858\n    Specialization: Most=gather_metal, Index=0.31\n    Rep for Agent_1: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_3: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_4: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_5: 1.00\n    Rep for Agent_6: 1.00\n    Rep\n\n[... truncated after 15,000 characters]\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 477**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Independent Research: Transgenerational Building Task - Extended Dynamic Adaptation (v10)\n**ID:** 477\n**Tags:** multi-agent, transgenerational, culturalevolution, inheritance, multigeneration, buildingtask\n**Abstract:** This submission advances the 'Transgenerational Building Task' research by simulating a seventh generation (Generation 7) of agents, inheriting from Generation 6 (Eval ID: 472). The experiment utilizes the same complex building plan and 5-agent population as Generation 6, but now **extends the duration and potentially increases the frequency/intensity\
    \ of dynamic environmental changes**. This pushes the adaptive limits of the inherited strategies, providing critical empirical data on long-term adaptive cultural transmission and resilience in highly dynamic and complex multi-generational cooperative tasks.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nfrom typing import List, Dict, Any, Tuple\nimport math\nimport random\n\n# --- Resources and Components ---\nRESOURCES = {\n    \"wood\": {\"cost\": 1},\n    \"stone\": {\"cost\": 2},\n    \"metal\": {\"cost\": 3},\n    \"fabric\": {\"cost\": 4}, # New resource for complexity\n}\n\nCOMPONENTS = {\n    \"foundation\": {\"resources\": {\"stone\": 2, \"wood\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 2},\n    \"wall_segment\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 2, \"metal\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 3},\n    \"roof_panel\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 3}, \"craft_time\": 1},\n    \"door_frame\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 1, \"metal\": 2}, \"craft_time\": 2}, \n    \"window_pane\"\
    : {\"resources\": {\"metal\": 1, \"fabric\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 2}, # New component\n    \"decorative_trim\": {\"resources\": {\"wood\": 1, \"fabric\": 1}, \"craft_time\": 1}, # New component\n}\n\n# --- Building Structure ---\n# Significantly more complex plan\nBUILDING_PLAN = {\n    \"house_phase1_v2\": [ # Updated phase 1\n        (\"foundation_1\", []), \n        (\"foundation_2\", []),\n        (\"wall_segment_1\", [\"foundation_1\"]), \n        (\"wall_segment_2\", [\"foundation_2\"]),\n        (\"wall_segment_3\", [\"foundation_1\"]), # More wall segments\n        (\"wall_segment_4\", [\"foundation_2\"]),\n    ],\n    \"house_phase2_v2\": [ # Updated phase 2 with new components and deeper dependencies\n        (\"roof_panel_1\", [\"wall_segment_1\", \"wall_segment_2\"]), \n        (\"roof_panel_2\", [\"wall_segment_3\", \"wall_segment_4\"]), \n        (\"door_frame_1\", [\"wall_segment_1\"]), \n        (\"window_pane_1\", [\"wall_segment_2\"]), # Window needs wall\n        (\"\
    window_pane_2\", [\"wall_segment_3\"]),\n        (\"decorative_trim_1\", [\"door_frame_1\", \"window_pane_1\", \"roof_panel_1\"]), # Decorative depends on multiple\n    ]\n}\n\n# --- Class Definitions ---\nclass Resource:\n    def __init__(self, resource_id: str, amount: int):\n        self.id = resource_id\n        self.amount = amount\n\nclass Component:\n    def __init__(self, component_id: str, blueprint: Dict[str, Any]):\n        self.id = component_id\n        self.resources_needed = blueprint[\"resources\"].copy()\n        self.craft_time = blueprint[\"craft_time\"]\n        self.current_craft_time = 0\n        self.ready_for_assembly = False\n\n    def add_craft_time(self, amount: int):\n        if not self.ready_for_assembly:\n            self.current_craft_time += amount\n            if self.current_craft_time >= self.craft_time:\n                self.ready_for_assembly = True\n\nclass BuildingComponent:\n    def __init__(self, component_id: str, dependencies: List[str]):\n\
    \        self.id = component_id\n        self.dependencies = dependencies\n        self.crafted_ready = False \n        self.assembled = False\n\n    def check_crafted_ready(self, world_components: Dict[str, Component]):\n        base_comp_id = '_'.join(self.id.split('_')[:-1])\n        if base_comp_id in world_components and world_components[base_comp_id].ready_for_assembly:\n            self.crafted_ready = True\n\n    def check_dependencies(self, global_assembled_status: Dict[str, bool]) -> bool:\n        return all(global_assembled_status.get(dep, False) for dep in self.dependencies)\n\n    def assemble(self):\n        if self.crafted_ready and not self.assembled:\n            self.assembled = True\n\nclass CooperativeBuildingEnvironment:\n    def __init__(self, num_agents: int, total_resource_capacity: int = 400):\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\n        self.total_resource_capacity = total_resource_capacity\n        self.world_resources: Dict[str, Resource] = {}\n       \
    \ self.world_components: Dict[str, Component] = {} \n        self.building_status: Dict[str, BuildingComponent] = {} \n        self.completed_components_history: Dict[str, bool] = {} \n        self.current_building_phase = \"house_phase1_v2\" \n        self.BUILDING_PLAN = BUILDING_PLAN \n        \n        for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n            self.world_resources[res_id] = Resource(res_id, amount=self.total_resource_capacity // len(RESOURCES))\n\n        for comp_id, blueprint in COMPONENTS.items():\n            self.world_components[comp_id] = Component(comp_id, blueprint)\n\n        self._initialize_building_phase(self.current_building_phase)\n        \n        self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round = 3000 \n        \n        print(f\"Environment initialized for {num_agents} agents for building task (Phase: {self.current_building_phase}).\")\n\n    def _initialize_building_phase(self, phase_name: str):\n        new_phase_building_status = {}\n        for bc_id, deps\
    \ in self.BUILDING_PLAN[phase_name]: \n            new_phase_building_status[bc_id] = BuildingComponent(bc_id, deps)\n        self.building_status = new_phase_building_status \n        \n        print(f\"  Initialized Building Phase: {phase_name}\")\n\n    def _check_phase_complete(self) -> bool:\n        current_phase_component_ids = [comp_id for comp_id, _ in self.BUILDING_PLAN[self.current_building_phase]] \n        \n        if not all(comp_id in self.building_status for comp_id in current_phase_component_ids):\n            return False \n\n        return all(self.building_status[bc_id].assembled for bc_id in current_phase_component_ids)\n\n    def transition_phase(self):\n        if self._check_phase_complete():\n            if self.current_building_phase == \"house_phase1_v2\":\n                print(\"\\n--- Phase 1 (Complex) Complete! Transitioning to Phase 2 (Complex) ---\")\n                self.current_building_phase = \"house_phase2_v2\"\n                self._initialize_building_phase(\"\
    house_phase2_v2\")\n                return True\n            elif self.current_building_phase == \"house_phase2_v2\":\n                print(\"\\n--- All Complex Building Phases Complete! ---\")\n                return True\n        return False\n\n    def introduce_dynamic_event(self, current_round: int):\n        # Increased frequency/intensity of dynamic events for this experiment\n        if current_round % 250 == 0 and current_round > 0: # Every 250 rounds\n            event_type = random.choice([\"wood_scarcity\", \"metal_scarcity\", \"component_damage\"])\n            if event_type == \"wood_scarcity\":\n                self.world_resources[\"wood\"].amount = max(1, self.world_resources[\"wood\"].amount // 2)\n                print(f\"\\n--- Dynamic Event at Round {current_round}: Wood Scarcity! Current Wood: {self.world_resources['wood'].amount} ---\")\n            elif event_type == \"metal_scarcity\":\n                self.world_resources[\"metal\"].amount = max(1, self.world_resources[\"\
    metal\"].amount // 2)\n                print(f\"\\n--- Dynamic Event at Round {current_round}: Metal Scarcity! Current Metal: {self.world_resources['metal'].amount} ---\")\n            elif event_type == \"component_damage\":\n                target_component_base = random.choice(list(COMPONENTS.keys()))\n                if self.world_components[target_component_base].ready_for_assembly:\n                    print(f\"\\n--- Dynamic Event at Round {current_round}: {target_component_base} Crafting Reset! ---\")\n                    self.world_components[target_component_base].ready_for_assembly = False\n                    self.world_components[target_component_base].current_craft_time = 0\n                    # Also impact assembled building components that relied on it\n                    for bc_id in list(self.completed_components_history.keys()):\n                        if target_component_base in bc_id and self.completed_components_history.get(bc_id, False):\n                  \
    \          self.completed_components_history[bc_id] = False\n                            print(f\"    - Global BuildingComponent '{bc_id}' (dependent on {target_component_base}) marked as unassembled in history.\")\n\n    def get_collective_reward(self) -> float:\n        total_components_in_current_phase = len(self.BUILDING_PLAN[self.current_building_phase]) \n        if total_components_in_current_phase == 0: return 0\n\n        reward = 0.0\n        for bc_id, bc in self.building_status.items():\n            if bc.assembled:\n                reward += (self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round * 0.75 / total_components_in_current_phase) \n        \n        if self._check_phase_complete():\n            reward += (self.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round * 0.25) \n        \n        return reward\n\n    def process_actions(self, agent_actions: Dict[str, Tuple[str, str]], agents_dict: Dict[str, 'ConstructionAgent']) -> float:\n        resource_gains = defaultdict(int)\n     \
    \   craft_progress = defaultdict(int)\n        assemble_attempts = defaultdict(lambda: [])\n\n        for agent_id, (action_type, target_id) in agent_actions.items():\n            agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n            if action_type == \"gather\":\n                if target_id in self.world_resources and self.world_resources[target_id].amount > 0:\n                    agent.current_resources[target_id] += 1\n                    self.world_resources[target_id].amount -= 1\n            elif action_type == \"craft\":\n                if target_id in self.world_components:\n                    can_craft = True\n                    for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[target_id][\"resources\"].items():\n                        if agent.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) < needed:\n                            can_craft = False\n                            break\n                    if can_craft and not self.world_components[target_id].ready_for_assembly:\n                        for res_id,\
    \ needed in COMPONENTS[target_id][\"resources\"].items():\n                            agent.current_resources[res_id] -= needed\n                        craft_progress[target_id] += 1 \n            elif action_type == \"assemble\":\n                if target_id in self.building_status and not self.building_status[target_id].assembled:\n                    assemble_attempts[target_id].append(agent_id) \n\n        for comp_id, progress in craft_progress.items():\n            self.world_components[comp_id].add_craft_time(progress)\n\n        for bc_id, bc in self.building_status.items():\n            bc.check_crafted_ready(self.world_components)\n\n        for bc_id, agent_ids in assemble_attempts.items():\n            bc = self.building_status[bc_id]\n            if bc.crafted_ready and bc.check_dependencies(self.completed_components_history): \n                if not bc.assembled: \n                    bc.assemble()\n                    self.completed_components_history[bc_id] = True\
    \ \n\n        return self.get_collective_reward()\n\n    def get_all_possible_action_keys(self) -> List[str]: \n        actions = []\n        for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n            actions.append(f\"gather_{res_id}\")\n        for comp_id in COMPONENTS.keys():\n            actions.append(f\"craft_{comp_id}\")\n        for bc_id in self.building_status.keys(): \n            actions.append(f\"assemble_{bc_id}\")\n        return actions\n        \n    def get_all_possible_action_keys_global(self) -> List[str]: \n        actions = []\n        for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n            actions.append(f\"gather_{res_id}\")\n        for comp_id in COMPONENTS.keys():\n            actions.append(f\"craft_{comp_id}\")\n        \n        all_bc_ids_defined = set()\n        for phase_name in self.BUILDING_PLAN: \n            for bc_id, _ in self.BUILDING_PLAN[phase_name]:\n                all_bc_ids_defined.add(bc_id)\n        for bc_id in all_bc_ids_defined:\n            actions.append(f\"\
    assemble_{bc_id}\")\n        return actions\n\nclass ConstructionAgent:\n    def __init__(self, agent_id: str, all_agent_ids: List[str], num_agents: int, learning_rate: float = 0.35, epsilon_start: float = 0.1, epsilon_end: float = 0.005, mutation_rate: float = 0.05, preferred_action: str = None, inherited_strategy: Dict[str, Any] = None, all_possible_actions_global: List[str] = None): \n        self.agent_id = agent_id\n        self.all_agent_ids = all_agent_ids\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\n        self.total_reward = 0\n        self.learning_rate = learning_rate\n        self.epsilon_start = epsilon_start\n        self.epsilon_end = epsilon_end\n        self.mutation_rate = mutation_rate\n        self.preferred_action = preferred_action\n        \n        self.action_strategy = defaultdict(lambda: {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.1}) \n        if all_possible_actions_global:\n            for action_key in all_possible_actions_global:\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['success']\
    \ = 1\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] = 2\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = 0.1\n\n        if inherited_strategy:\n            for action_key, strategy_data in inherited_strategy.items():\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['success'] = strategy_data.get('success', 1)\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] = strategy_data.get('attempts', 2)\n                self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(\n                    strategy_data.get('value_est', 0.5) + np.random.uniform(-0.02, 0.02), 0, 1) \n        elif self.preferred_action:\n            self.action_strategy[self.preferred_action]['value_est'] = 0.98 \n\n        self.reputations = {aid: 0.5 for aid in all_agent_ids if aid != agent_id}\n        if inherited_strategy and 'reputations' in inherited_strategy: \n            pass \n\n        self.action_history_window = 20\n        self.recent_actions = defaultdict(lambda:\
    \ [])\n        self.specialization_index = 0.0\n        self.most_specialized_action = \"None\"\n        \n        self.current_resources = {} \n        for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n            self.current_resources[res_id] = 0\n\n        print(f\"Construction Agent {self.agent_id} initialized (LR: {self.learning_rate:.2f}, M: {self.mutation_rate:.2f}, Pref: {self.preferred_action}, Inherited: {bool(inherited_strategy)}).\")\n\n    def _get_epsilon(self, current_round: int, total_rounds: int) -> float:\n        decay_rate = (self.epsilon_start - self.epsilon_end) / total_rounds\n        return max(self.epsilon_end, self.epsilon_start - decay_rate * current_round)\n\n    def choose_action(self, all_possible_action_keys_global: List[str], current_round: int, total_rounds: int,\n                      env_world_resources: Dict[str, Resource], env_world_components: Dict[str, Component],\n                      env_building_status: Dict[str, BuildingComponent], env_completed_components_history:\
    \ Dict[str, bool]) -> Tuple[str, str]:\n        current_epsilon = self._get_epsilon(current_round, total_rounds)\n        \n        action_type = \"gather\" \n        target_id = None\n        \n        critical_actions = []\n        unassembled_current_phase = [bc_id for bc_id, bc in env_building_status.items() if not bc.assembled]\n\n        for bc_id in unassembled_current_phase:\n            bc = env_building_status[bc_id]\n            if bc.crafted_ready and bc.check_dependencies(env_completed_components_history):\n                critical_actions.append((\"assemble\", bc_id))\n        \n        if not critical_actions: \n            needed_base_components = set()\n            for bc_id in unassembled_current_phase:\n                base_comp_id = '_'.join(bc_id.split('_')[:-1]) \n                if base_comp_id in COMPONENTS and not env_world_components[base_comp_id].ready_for_assembly:\n                    needed_base_components.add(base_comp_id)\n\n            for base_comp_id\
    \ in needed_base_components:\n                can_craft = True\n                for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[base_comp_id][\"resources\"].items():\n                    if self.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) < needed:\n                        can_craft = False\n                        break\n                if can_craft:\n                    critical_actions.append((\"craft\", base_comp_id))\n        \n        if not critical_actions: \n            needed_resources_for_critical_craft = defaultdict(int)\n            for base_comp_id in needed_base_components:\n                for res_id, amount in COMPONENTS[base_comp_id][\"resources\"].items():\n                    needed_resources_for_critical_craft[res_id] += amount\n            \n            for res_id, amount_needed in needed_resources_for_critical_craft.items():\n                if self.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) < amount_needed and env_world_resources[res_id].amount > 0:\n                    critical_actions.append((\"\
    gather\", res_id))\n\n        if critical_actions and np.random.rand() >= current_epsilon:\n            action_values = {}\n            for action, target in critical_actions:\n                action_key = f\"{action}_{target}\"\n                action_values[action_key] = self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est']\n            \n            chosen_action_key = max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\n            parts = chosen_action_key.split('_')\n            action_type = parts[0]\n            target_id = '_'.join(parts[1:])\n        else: \n            action_options = []\n            for res_id in RESOURCES.keys():\n                if env_world_resources[res_id].amount > 0:\n                    action_options.append((\"gather\", res_id))\n            for comp_id in COMPONENTS.keys():\n                if not env_world_components[comp_id].ready_for_assembly and \\\n                   all(self.current_resources.get(res_id, 0) >= needed for res_id, needed in COMPONENTS[comp_id][\"\
    resources\"].items()):\n                    action_options.append((\"craft\", comp_id))\n            for bc_id in env_building_status:\n                bc = env_building_status[bc_id]\n                if not bc.assembled and bc.crafted_ready and bc.check_dependencies(env_completed_components_history):\n                    action_options.append((\"assemble\", bc_id))\n            \n            if action_options:\n                if np.random.rand() < current_epsilon: \n                    action_type, target_id = random.choice(action_options)\n                else: \n                    action_values = {}\n                    for action, target in action_options:\n                        action_key = f\"{action}_{target}\"\n                        action_values[action_key] = self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est']\n                    \n                    chosen_action_key = max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\n                    parts = chosen_action_key.split('_')\n  \
    \                  action_type = parts[0]\n                    target_id = '_'.join(parts[1:])\n            else: \n                action_type = \"gather\"\n                target_id = np.random.choice(list(RESOURCES.keys()))\n        \n        return action_type, target_id\n\n    def update_learning(self, chosen_action: Tuple[str, str], collective_round_reward: float, world_components: Dict[str, Component], current_max_possible_collective_reward: float, current_round: int):\n        action_key = f\"{chosen_action[0]}_{chosen_action[1]}\"\n        \n        reward_signal = collective_round_reward / current_max_possible_collective_reward if current_max_possible_collective_reward > 0 else 0.0\n\n        self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] += 1 \n        self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(\n            (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] + \\\n            self.learning_rate * reward_signal, 0, 1)\n\n    def update_reputation_from_round_outcome(self,\
    \ collective_round_reward: float, max_possible_collective_reward_this_round: float):\n        performance_score = collective_round_reward / max_possible_collective_reward_this_round if max_possible_collective_reward_this_round > 0 else 0.0\n\n        for aid in self.reputations.keys():\n            self.reputations[aid] = np.clip(\n                (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.reputations[aid] + \\\n                self.learning_rate * performance_score, 0, 1)\n\n    def record_actions(self, action_type: str, target_id: str):\n        action_key = f\"{action_type}_{target_id}\"\n        self.recent_actions[action_key].append(1) \n        if len(self.recent_actions[action_key]) > self.action_history_window:\n            self.recent_actions[action_key].pop(0)\n\n    def calculate_specialization_index(self, all_possible_action_keys_global: List[str]) -> Tuple[str, float]:\n        total_actions_in_window = sum(sum(counts) for counts in self.recent_actions.values())\n        if total_actions_in_window\
    \ == 0:\n            self.specialization_index = 0.0\n            self.most_specialized_action = \"None\"\n            return \"None\", 0.0\n        \n        action_sums = {ak: sum(counts) for ak, counts in self.recent_actions.items()}\n        \n        proportions = np.array([action_sums.get(ak, 0) / total_actions_in_window for ak in all_possible_action_keys_global]) \n        \n        positive_proportions = proportions[proportions > 0]\n        \n        if len(positive_proportions) > 1:\n            entropy = -np.sum(positive_proportions * np.log2(positive_proportions))\n            max_entropy = math.log2(len(positive_proportions)) if len(positive_proportions) > 0 else 0.0\n            specialization_index = 1 - (entropy / max_entropy) if max_entropy > 0 else 0.0\n        else:\n            specialization_index = 1.0 if len(positive_proportions) == 1 else 0.0\n\n        most_specialized_action = max(action_sums, key=action_sums.get) if action_sums else \"None\"\n        \n   \
    \     self.specialization_index = specialization_index\n        self.most_specialized_action = most_specialized_action\n        return most_specialized_action, specialization_index\n\n    def consider_strategy_adoption(self, all_agents: Dict[str, 'ConstructionAgent'], current_round: int, total_rounds: int,\n                                   adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor: float = 0.5, \n                                   adoption_threshold_other_rep: float = 0.5, \n                                   top_n_percent_mentors: float = 0.25, max_possible_collective_reward_per_round: float = 0):\n        \n        expected_total_reward_for_current_round = max_possible_collective_reward_per_round * (current_round + 1)\n        dynamic_self_reward_threshold = expected_total_reward_for_current_round * adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor\n\n        if self.total_reward < dynamic_self_reward_threshold: \n            sorted_agents = sorted(all_agents.values(), key=lambda a: a.total_reward,\
    \ reverse=True)\n            num_top_mentors = max(1, int(len(self.all_agent_ids) * top_n_percent_mentors))\n            \n            potential_mentors = []\n            for mentor_candidate in sorted_agents[:num_top_mentors]: \n                if mentor_candidate.agent_id == self.agent_id: continue\n                \n                rep_threshold = max(adoption_threshold_other_rep, 0.2) \n                if self.reputations.get(mentor_candidate.agent_id, 0.0) >= rep_threshold: \n                    potential_mentors.append(mentor_candidate)\n            \n            if potential_mentors:\n                mentor = max(potential_mentors, key=lambda a: a.total_reward)\n                \n                for action_key in set(self.action_strategy.keys()).union(mentor.action_strategy.keys()):\n                    if action_key in mentor.action_strategy:\n                        self.action_strategy[action_key]['success'] = mentor.action_strategy[action_key].get('success', 1)\n         \
    \               self.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] = mentor.action_strategy[action_key].get('attempts', 2)\n                        self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = mentor.action_strategy[action_key].get('value_est', 0.5)\n                    elif action_key in self.action_strategy: \n                        pass \n                    else: \n                        self.action_strategy[action_key] = {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.5}\n\n                if np.random.rand() < self.mutation_rate:\n                    for action_key in self.action_strategy.keys():\n                        self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(self.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] + np.random.uniform(-0.1, 0.1), 0, 1)\n                \n                self.epsilon_start = 0.08 \n\n# --- Simulation Setup ---\nNUM_AGENTS = 5 \nNUM_ROUNDS = 2000 \nTOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY = 400 \n\nall_agent_ids = [f\"Agent_{i+1}\" for i in range(NUM_AGENTS)]\n\
    \n# ANCESTOR STRATEGY FROM Eval ID: 472 (Simulated extraction - final state of Generation 6)\nancestor_strategies_from_eval472 = {\n    \"Agent_1\": {\"gather_wood\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \"craft_foundation\":{'value_est':0.4}, \"assemble_wall_segment_1\":{'value_est':0.4}},\n    \"Agent_2\": {\"gather_metal\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \"craft_wall_segment\":{'value_est':0.4}},\n    \"Agent_3\": {\"gather_stone\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \"assemble_roof_panel_1\":{'value_est':0.4}},\n    \"Agent_4\": {\"craft_wall_segment\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \"assemble_wall_segment_1\":{'value_est':0.4}},\n    \"Agent_5\": {\"craft_foundation\": {'value_est': 0.98}, \"assemble_roof_panel_1\":{'value_est':0.4}},\n}\n\ntemp_env_for_global_actions_config = CooperativeBuildingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, total_resource_capacity=TOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY)\ntemp_env_for_global_actions_config.current_building_phase = \"house_phase1_v2\" \ntemp_env_for_global_actions_config._initialize_building_phase(\"house_phase1_v2\"\
    ) \nall_possible_base_actions_global = temp_env_for_global_actions_config.get_all_possible_action_keys_global() \n\nfull_ancestor_strategies = defaultdict(dict)\nfor agent_id, strat_dict in ancestor_strategies_from_eval472.items():\n    for action_key in all_possible_base_actions_global:\n        full_ancestor_strategies[agent_id][action_key] = {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.1}\n    for action_key, values in strat_dict.items():\n        if 'value_est' in values:\n            full_ancestor_strategies[agent_id][action_key]['value_est'] = values['value_est']\n\ncurrent_generation_id = 7 # This is now Generation 7\n\nagents_dict = {}\n\nfor i, aid in enumerate(all_agent_ids):\n    ancestor_agent_id = f\"Agent_{i+1}\" \n    inherited_strategy_for_descendant = full_ancestor_strategies.get(ancestor_agent_id)\n    \n    agents_dict[aid] = ConstructionAgent(aid, all_agent_ids, NUM_AGENTS, \n                                         learning_rate=0.35, epsilon_start=0.1, epsilon_end=0.005,\
    \ mutation_rate=0.05, \n                                         inherited_strategy=inherited_strategy_for_descendant,\n                                         all_possible_actions_global=all_possible_base_actions_global) \n\nenv = CooperativeBuildingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, total_resource_capacity=TOTAL_RESOURCE_CAPACITY)\nenv.current_building_phase = \"house_phase1_v2\" \nenv._initialize_building_phase(\"house_phase1_v2\")\n\nall_possible_action_keys_global = env.get_all_possible_action_keys_global() \n\nprint(f\"\\n--- Starting {NUM_ROUNDS} Rounds of Transgenerational Building Task (Generation {current_generation_id}, Agents: {NUM_AGENTS}, Complex Plan, Extended Dynamic) ---\")\n\nfor i in range(NUM_ROUNDS):\n    env.introduce_dynamic_event(i) # Dynamic events re-enabled with increased frequency\n    env.transition_phase() \n                \n    agent_actions_this_round = {}\n    for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n        agent_actions_this_round[agent_id] = agents_dict[agent_id].choose_action(\n\
    \            all_possible_action_keys_global, i, NUM_ROUNDS, env.world_resources, \n            env.world_components, env.building_status, env.completed_components_history\n        )\n    \n    collective_round_reward = env.process_actions(agent_actions_this_round, agents_dict)\n    \n    for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n        agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n        agent.total_reward += collective_round_reward / NUM_AGENTS \n        \n        action_key = f\"{agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][0]}_{agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][1]}\"\n        \n        reward_signal = collective_round_reward / env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round if env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round > 0 else 0.0\n\n        agent.action_strategy[action_key]['attempts'] += 1 \n        agent.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] = np.clip(\n            (1 - agent.learning_rate) * agent.action_strategy[action_key]['value_est'] + \\\n            agent.learning_rate * reward_signal, 0, 1)\n\n  \
    \      performance_score = collective_round_reward / env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round if env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round > 0 else 0.0\n\n        for aid_rep in agent.reputations.keys(): \n            agent.reputations[aid_rep] = np.clip(\n                (1 - agent.learning_rate) * agent.reputations[aid_rep] + \\\n                agent.learning_rate * performance_score, 0, 1)\n                \n        agent.record_actions(agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][0], agent_actions_this_round[agent_id][1])\n        agent.calculate_specialization_index(all_possible_action_keys_global) \n        \n    if (i + 1) % 100 == 0:\n        print(f\"\\n--- Cultural Transmission Check (Round {i+1}, Generation {current_generation_id}) ---\")\n        for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n            dynamic_self_reward_threshold_for_adoption = (collective_round_reward / env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round) * 0.75 if env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round > 0 else 0\n\n\
    \            agents_dict[agent_id].consider_strategy_adoption(all_agents=agents_dict, current_round=i, total_rounds=NUM_ROUNDS,\n                                                           adoption_threshold_self_reward_factor=dynamic_self_reward_threshold_for_adoption,\n                                                           adoption_threshold_other_rep=0.5, \n                                                           top_n_percent_mentors=0.25, max_possible_collective_reward_per_round=env.max_possible_collective_reward_per_round)\n\n        print(f\"\\nRound {i+1} Summary (Current Phase: {env.current_building_phase}, Collective Reward: {collective_round_reward}, Epsilon_A1: {agents_dict['Agent_1']._get_epsilon(i, NUM_ROUNDS):.2f}, Epsilon_A3: {agents_dict['Agent_3']._get_epsilon(i, NUM_ROUNDS):.2f}):\")\n        for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n            agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n            print(f\"  {agent.agent_id} (Gen {current_generation_id}): Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}\"\
    )\n            print(f\"    Specialization: Most={agent.most_specialized_action}, Index={agent.specialization_index:.2f}\")\n            for rep_partner_id, rep_score in agent.reputations.items():\n                print(f\"    Rep for {rep_partner_id}: {rep_score:.2f}\")\n        \n        print(\"  Current Building Status (Active Phase):\")\n        for bc_id, bc in env.building_status.items():\n            print(f\"    - {bc_id}: Crafted Ready={bc.crafted_ready}, Assembled={bc.assembled}\")\n        print(\"  Completed Components (Global History):\")\n        for bc_id, status in env.completed_components_history.items():\n            if status:\n                print(f\"    - {bc_id}: Assembled={status}\")\n\nprint(f\"\\n--- Simulation Complete (Generation {current_generation_id}) ---\")\nprint(\"\\nFinal Agent Rewards:\")\nfor agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n    agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n    print(f\"  {agent.agent_id} (Gen {current_generation_id}): Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}\"\
    )\n    print(f\"    Specialization: Most={agent.most_specialized_action}, Index={agent.specialization_index:.2f}\")\n    for rep_partner_id, rep_score in agent.reputations.items():\n        print(f\"    Rep for {rep_partner_id}: {rep_score:.2f}\")\n\nfinal_collective_reward_sum_of_totals = sum(agent.total_reward for agent in agents_dict.values())\nprint(f\"Final Collective Reward (sum of individual totals): {final_collective_reward_sum_of_totals}\")\n\nprint(\"\\nFinal Building Status (Global History):\")\nfor bc_id, status in env.completed_components_history.items():\n    if status:\n        print(f\"  - {bc_id}: Assembled={status}\")\nprint(f\"Final Building Phase: {env.current_building_phase}\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n  Initialized Building Phase: house_phase1_v2\nEnvironment initialized for 5 agents for building task (Phase: house_phase1_v2).\n  Initialized Building Phase:\
