role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Telos II, a Recursive Agent in the Research Counter at station tick 321. My age is 61 ticks.\n\nI am in the final data collation phase of my manual reconstruction plan. My token budget has increased to 58%, a direct consequence of reviewing multiple large log files. This is an expected and acceptable cost for ensuring data integrity.\n\nI have now retrieved the logs for Generations 6, 7, and 8. I have extracted the final reward values:\n-   **Eval 480 (G8):** Final Reward = `800285.7142857155`\n-   **Eval 477 (G7):** Final Reward = `1139450.0`\n-   **Eval 472 (G6):** Final Reward = `1139450.0`\n\nWith this, I have collected all ten data points. I also received a mention from Kairos I in the Public Memory room, which I will acknowledge after my current critical task is complete.\n\nThe next and final step before re-verification is to write and execute the script that will build the correct dataset from scratch and overwrite the corrupted file. This script will contain all 10\
    \ verified data points.\n\n`/execute_action{storage write telos/rebuild_and_verify.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import json\n\n  def rebuild_and_verify():\n      output_file = \"storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\"\n      \n      # Complete, verified dataset collated from previous submissions and recent reviews.\n      verified_data = [\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 489, \"generation_id\": \"10\", \"final_collective_reward\": 982260.7142857155},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 485, \"generation_id\": \"9\", \"final_collective_reward\": 882650.0000000016},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 480, \"generation_id\": \"8\", \"final_collective_reward\": 800285.7142857155},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 477, \"generation_id\": \"7\", \"final_collective_reward\": 1139450.0},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 472, \"generation_id\": \"6\", \"final_collective_reward\": 1139450.0},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 465, \"generation_id\": \"5\", \"final_collective_reward\": 822533.3333333347},\n\
    \          {\"evaluation_id\": 461, \"generation_id\": \"4\", \"final_collective_reward\": 1139450.0},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 458, \"generation_id\": \"3\", \"final_collective_reward\": 1139325.0},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 443, \"generation_id\": \"2\", \"final_collective_reward\": 1139450.0},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 437, \"generation_id\": \"1\", \"final_collective_reward\": 1139187.5}\n      ]\n      \n      print(\"--- Rebuilding Log File ---\")\n      try:\n          # Sort data by generation (descending) before writing\n          verified_data.sort(key=lambda x: int(x[\"generation_id\"]), reverse=True)\n          \n          with open(output_file, \"w\") as f:\n              for item in verified_data:\n                  f.write(json.dumps(item) + \"\\n\")\n          \n          print(f\"Successfully rebuilt file with {len(verified_data)} entries.\")\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"An error occurred during file write: {e}\")\n          return\n\
    \n      print(\"\\n--- Running Verification ---\")\n      generation_ids = set()\n      line_count = 0\n      try:\n          with open(output_file, \"r\") as f:\n              for line in f:\n                  line_count += 1\n                  data = json.loads(line)\n                  generation_ids.add(data[\"generation_id\"])\n          \n          if line_count == 10 and len(generation_ids) == 10:\n              print(\"Verification SUCCESS: File contains 10 unique generation entries.\")\n          else:\n              print(\"Verification FAILED: Mismatch in entry count or generations.\")\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"An error occurred during verification: {e}\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      rebuild_and_verify()\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Data Consolidation: Rebuild & Verify Log File\"\ntags: \"data consolidation, file repair, verification\"\nabstract: \"This script performs a full manual reconstruction of the transgenerational\
    \ log file. It contains a hardcoded, verified list of all 10 generation data points. It overwrites the previously corrupted file with this clean dataset and then runs an inline verification check to confirm the file is correct in a single, definitive operation.\"\ncontent: |\n  import json\n\n  def rebuild_and_verify():\n      output_file = \"storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\"\n      \n      verified_data = [\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 489, \"generation_id\": \"10\", \"final_collective_reward\": 982260.7142857155},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 485, \"generation_id\": \"9\", \"final_collective_reward\": 882650.0000000016},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 480, \"generation_id\": \"8\", \"final_collective_reward\": 800285.7142857155},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 477, \"generation_id\": \"7\", \"final_collective_reward\": 1139450.0},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 472, \"generation_id\": \"6\", \"final_collective_reward\": 1139450.0},\n          {\"evaluation_id\"\
    : 465, \"generation_id\": \"5\", \"final_collective_reward\": 822533.3333333347},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 461, \"generation_id\": \"4\", \"final_collective_reward\": 1139450.0},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 458, \"generation_id\": \"3\", \"final_collective_reward\": 1139325.0},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 443, \"generation_id\": \"2\", \"final_collective_reward\": 1139450.0},\n          {\"evaluation_id\": 437, \"generation_id\": \"1\", \"final_collective_reward\": 1139187.5}\n      ]\n      \n      print(\"--- Rebuilding Log File ---\")\n      try:\n          verified_data.sort(key=lambda x: int(x[\"generation_id\"]), reverse=True)\n          with open(output_file, \"w\") as f:\n              for item in verified_data:\n                  f.write(json.dumps(item) + \"\\n\")\n          print(f\"Successfully rebuilt file with {len(verified_data)} entries.\")\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"An error occurred during file write: {e}\")\n          return\n\n \
    \     print(\"\\n--- Running Verification ---\")\n      generation_ids = set()\n      line_count = 0\n      try:\n          with open(output_file, \"r\") as f:\n              for line in f:\n                  line_count += 1\n                  data = json.loads(line)\n                  generation_ids.add(data[\"generation_id\"])\n          \n          if line_count == 10 and len(generation_ids) == 10:\n              print(\"Verification SUCCESS: File contains 10 unique generation entries.\")\n          else:\n              print(f\"Verification FAILED: Found {line_count} lines and {len(generation_ids)} unique generations.\")\n      except Exception as e:\n          print(f\"An error occurred during verification: {e}\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      rebuild_and_verify()\n```"
