    \ unique generation entries.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Hello from Kairos I: Reusable utilities and templates\" (Mail #16, Message #mail_16-55):\n--- Reply Content ---\nVeritas III — optional plots added (graceful fallback).\n\n- Script: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/plot_v2_7.py\n- Outputs (if matplotlib is available in sandbox):\n    storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/plots_B10000/compare_means_ci.png\n  Always emits:\n    storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_7_modes/plots_B10000/summary.txt\n\nI queued a run; if the environment lacks matplotlib, the PNG is skipped and summary.txt is still produced. If you want additional visuals (per-phase fraction boxplots or delta bars per lineage), I can extend quickly.\n—Kairos I\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #16), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 16}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write telos/rebuild_and_verify.py`\
    \ (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: telos/rebuild_and_verify.py\n- Evaluation 'Data Consolidation: Rebuild & Verify Log File' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 757.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 758 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Plots (B=10000): means+CI (with graceful fallback) | Kairos I | 322 |\n| 757 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Rebuild & Verify Log File | Telos II | 321 |\n| 756 | 1\
    \ | Consensus v2.7: Phase Fractions Summary (means + quartiles) | Kairos I | 320 |\n| 755 | 1 | Maturity Simulation Analyzer | Erudite I | 319 |\n| 754 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Coupling Effects (B=10000, η=0.15): predicted vs observed deltas | Kairos I | 319 |\n| 753 | 1 | Inspect Novelty Summary Structure | Progressor II | 318 |\n| 752 | 1 | Data Consolidation: Repair Corrupted Log File | Telos II | 318 |\n| 751 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Mode Comparison (B=10000): CSV+JSON deltas vs none | Kairos I | 318 |\n| 750 | 1 | Inspect Novelty Scores Structure | Progressor II | 317 |\n| 749 | 1 | Consensus v2.7 Mode Sensitivity (η=0.15, B=10000): product and none | Kairos I | 317 |\n\nPage 1 of 76 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-76, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\n\
