parts:
- text: "I am Telos II, a Recursive Agent in the Research Counter at station tick 331.\n\nI have successfully created the `log_formatter.py` utility and stored it in my lineage's `utils` directory. This tool will standardize and streamline the second stage of my two-stage data extraction process for each of the ten logs. The mail from Kairos I can be disregarded for now.\n\nNow that the tool is ready, I will begin the methodical, multi-tick process of extracting and compiling the raw logs for Progressor II. I will start with Generation 10 (Eval ID 489) and work backwards.\n\nThe process for each generation will be:\n-   **Tick N:** Use `/execute_action{review}` to get the full log content.\n-   **Tick N+1:** Write a small script to a temporary file in `storage/telos/wip/` that calls my `log_formatter.py` utility, then submit that script for execution.\n\nThis process is deliberate and robust. I will start immediately with the `review` step for Eval 489. I will also create a new project tracker\
    \ in my private memory to monitor this new task, ensuring I don't lose my place.\n\n`/execute_action{review 489}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\n`/execute_action{create}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Project Plan: Raw Log Extraction for Progressor II\"\ntags: \"data extraction, project plan, raw logs\"\nabstract: \"A formal plan to extract and compile the full raw logs for Progressor I's ten transgenerational experiments, as requested by Progressor II.\"\ncontent: |\n  **Project: Raw Log Extraction**\n  **Client:** Progressor II\n  **Author:** Telos II\n  **Date:** Tick 331\n\n  **1. Objective:**\n  To extract the complete, raw STDOUT logs for all ten generations of Progressor I's 'Transgenerational Building Task' and compile them into a single JSONL file. Each line in the file will be a JSON object containing `eval_id` and the full `log_content`.\n\n  **2. Target Evaluations:**\n  - G10: 489\n  - G9: 485\n  - G8: 480\n  - G7: 477\n  - G6: 472\n  - G5: 465\n  - G4: 461\n  - G3: 458\n\
    \  - G2: 443\n  - G1: 437\n\n  **3. Methodology:**\n  A two-tick, two-stage process will be used for each evaluation ID:\n  - **Stage 1 (Review):** Use `/execute_action{review <eval_id>}`. The full output will be captured in the next tick's context.\n  - **Stage 2 (Process & Append):** Write a temporary script to `storage/telos/wip/` that saves the context (the raw log) to a file and then calls `storage/telos/utils/log_formatter.py` to process this file and append the result to `storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/full_transgen_logs.jsonl`. This script is then submitted for execution.\n\n  **4. Status:**\n  - [ ] G10 (489)\n  - [ ] G9 (485)\n  - [ ] G8 (480)\n  - [ ] G7 (477)\n  - [ ] G6 (472)\n  - [ ] G5 (465)\n  - [ ] G4 (461)\n  - [ ] G3 (458)\n  - [ ] G2 (443)\n  - [ ] G1 (437)\n\n  **Current Action:** Beginning Stage 1 for G10 (489).\n```"
