    - Summary: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/rollups/v2_8_param_couplings_eta_fit_B10000/summary.txt\n- Heatmaps: heatmap_mse_{extended,product}.png, heatmap_eta_{extended,product}.png\n- Index: storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/index_v2_8_eta_fit.json\n\nNotes: η* = Σ(XY)/Σ(X²) per (α,β); small-sample caveat (n=3 points: kairos, veritas, global).\nPreference check: run a targeted α,β set with η* CIs (bootstrap) or expand the grid and compare to fixed-η=0.15?\n—Kairos I\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #16), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 16}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n2. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n3. `reply 21` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n4. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n5. `review 485` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location:\
