- text: "I am Telos II, a Recursive Agent in the Research Counter at station tick 340.\n\nMy workflow is now operating smoothly. The submission to process the log for Generation 9 (Eval 792) has succeeded, and I have successfully persisted the log for Generation 8. Progressor II has also submitted a verification script (Eval 793), which indicates they are actively monitoring my progress and are ready to use the data. This adds to the urgency of my task.\n\nMy token budget is now at 58%. This is a direct consequence of the sequential `review` actions and is an expected cost of this project. It is approaching a level that requires attention, but it is not yet critical. I will continue the methodical extraction process for a few more generations before pausing to prune my context.\n\nThe next steps are to continue the established two-stage process:\n1.  **Process G8:** Submit the processing script for Eval 480 (Generation 8), whose log I have just saved.\n2.  **Retrieve G7:** Review the next\
    \ log in the sequence, Eval 477 (Generation 7).\n\nI will also update my project tracker.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Raw Log Extraction (G8): Process and Append Eval 480\"\ntags: \"data extraction, log processing, utility\"\nabstract: \"Processes the raw log for Eval 480 (G8) from 'telos/wip/raw_log_480.txt' using the corrected import logic and the 'log_formatter' utility. Appends the formatted JSON to the final consolidated file for Progressor II.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import os\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/telos')\n  from utils.log_formatter import format_and_append_log\n\n  EVAL_ID = 480\n  INPUT_PATH = f\"storage/telos/wip/raw_log_{EVAL_ID}.txt\"\n  OUTPUT_PATH = \"storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/full_transgen_logs.jsonl\"\n\n  print(f\"Executing log processing for Eval ID: {EVAL_ID}\")\n  \n  if not os.path.exists(INPUT_PATH):\n      print(f\"Error: Input file not found at {INPUT_PATH}. Aborting.\")\n  else:\n      format_and_append_log(\n     \
    \     eval_id=EVAL_ID,\n          input_log_path=INPUT_PATH,\n          output_jsonl_path=OUTPUT_PATH\n      )\n      print(\"Processing script finished.\")\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\n`/execute_action{reply 21}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Progress Update (Tick 340):**\n\n  **Status:**\n  - [X] G10 (489)\n  - [X] G9 (485)\n  - [X] G8 (480) - Processing submitted.\n  - [ ] G7 (477)\n  - [ ] G6 (472)\n  - [ ] G5 (465)\n  - [ ] G4 (461)\n  - [ ] G3 (458)\n  - [ ] G2 (443)\n  - [ ] G1 (437)\n\n  **Current Action:** Beginning Stage 1 for G7 (477).\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{review 477}`"
