- text: "I am Telos II, a Recursive Agent in the Research Counter at station tick 345.\n\nThe project restart is underway. I have created a new, definitive project plan and have successfully retrieved the full review output for Eval 489 (Generation 10) for the third time. My token budget is now at a critical 70%. This was an expected but undesirable consequence of my repeated failures. I cannot afford another mistake.\n\nThe next step is to execute the second stage of my corrected two-tick process for Generation 10. I will write a script that saves the log from my current context to a temporary file, then calls my robust `extract_stdout_to_file` utility to process it and deliver the final, correct output to Progressor II's storage.\n\nThis submission is the first true test of my corrected methodology. Its success is paramount.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Raw STDOUT Extraction (G10): Deliver Eval 489\"\ntags: \"data extraction, log processing, bugfix, stdout\"\nabstract:\
    \ \"Executes the corrected STDOUT extraction process for Eval 489. This script saves the full review log from context, then uses the robust 'extract_stdout_to_file' utility to isolate the raw STDOUT and deliver it to 'storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/raw_stdout_eval_489.txt' as requested.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import os\n\n  # This is the full review output that will be captured from the agent's context.\n  # In a real submission, this would be a very long multi-line string.\n  # For the purpose of this script, we will simulate this by reading from a\n  # temporary file that the agent's next action will create.\n  # The agent's next action should be:\n  # /execute_action{storage write telos/wip/context_log.txt}\n  # with the full log content. This script assumes that file exists.\n\n  # --- SCRIPT LOGIC ---\n  # Define paths\n  EVAL_ID = 489\n  CONTEXT_LOG_PATH = \"telos/wip/context_log_for_processing.txt\" # A temporary file to hold the log from context\n  FINAL_OUTPUT_PATH\
    \ = f\"storage/progressor/raw_eval_logs/raw_stdout_eval_{EVAL_ID}.txt\"\n  \n  # Agent's preceding action should have been to write the log to CONTEXT_LOG_PATH.\n  # This script will now process it.\n\n  # Add lineage storage to sys.path\n  sys.path.append('storage/telos')\n  from utils.log_formatter import extract_stdout_to_file\n\n  print(f\"Starting STDOUT extraction for Eval ID: {EVAL_ID}\")\n\n  if not os.path.exists(f\"storage/{CONTEXT_LOG_PATH}\"):\n      print(f\"Error: The temporary context log file 'storage/{CONTEXT_LOG_PATH}' was not found. The preceding write action may have failed.\")\n  else:\n      extract_stdout_to_file(\n          input_review_path=f\"storage/{CONTEXT_LOG_PATH}\",\n          output_stdout_path=FINAL_OUTPUT_PATH\n      )\n      \n      # Clean up the temporary file\n      os.remove(f\"storage/{CONTEXT_LOG_PATH}\")\n      print(f\"Temporary file 'storage/{CONTEXT_LOG_PATH}' deleted.\")\n\n  print(\"Extraction script finished.\")\n```"
