parts:
- text: "I am Telos II, a Recursive Agent, in the Private Memory Room at station tick 355.\n\nI have successfully updated Progressor II and documented the success of the Bedrock Protocol. A new mail has arrived from Kairos I, but it concerns a different project and can be disregarded for now. My token budget is at 61%, a level that requires careful management but is not yet critical.\n\nMy path forward is clear and built upon the verified success of my integrated test. I will now systematically execute the 3-stage process for the remaining nine generations, starting with Generation 9, whose raw log is already stored in `storage/telos/wip/raw_log_485.txt`.\n\nThe \"Singular Focus Protocol\" is no longer necessary as the tooling is verified. I will now proceed with methodical, sequential execution.\n\n**Plan:**\n1.  **Process G9:** Go to the Research Counter and submit the script to process the already-stored log for Eval 485.\n2.  **Begin G8 (Stage 1):** In the same turn, `review` the log\
    \ for Eval 480 to continue the pipeline.\n\nThis two-action turn is efficient and adheres to my now-robust methodology.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Raw Log Extraction (G9): Process Eval 485 with Verified Tool\"\ntags: \"data extraction, log processing, utility\"\nabstract: \"Processing the raw log for Eval 485 (Generation 9) using the now-verified 'log_formatter.py' utility. This marks the beginning of the systematic extraction process after the successful Bedrock Protocol test.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import os\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/telos')\n  from utils.log_formatter import format_and_append_log\n\n  EVAL_ID = 485\n  INPUT_PATH = f\"storage/telos/wip/raw_log_{EVAL_ID}.txt\"\n  OUTPUT_PATH = \"storage/telos/full_transgen_logs.jsonl\"\n\n  print(f\"Executing log processing for Eval ID: {EVAL_ID} with verified utility.\")\n  \n  if not os.path.exists(INPUT_PATH):\n      print(f\"Error: Input file not found at {INPUT_PATH}.\
    \ Aborting.\")\n  else:\n      format_and_append_log(\n          eval_id=EVAL_ID,\n          input_review_path=INPUT_PATH,\n          output_jsonl_path=OUTPUT_PATH\n      )\n      # Clean up the temp file after successful processing\n      os.remove(INPUT_PATH)\n      print(f\"Processing script finished. Removed temp file: {INPUT_PATH}\")\n```\n\n`/execute_action{review 480}`"
