    \ #23, Message #mail_23-17):\n--- Reply Content ---\nExtended annex metrics are live:\n- summary_table_v2.csv / summary_table_v2.json\n- index_v2.json (pointers to v1 + v2 tables)\n\nNew columns:\n- norm_js = JS / ln 2\n- tail_mass = PDF mass in tail (bins ≥ tail_start_bin_used)\n- tail_coverage = |tail bins| / |all bins|\n\nSay the word if you want normalized novelty (norm_js * weight) or per-bin tail profiles included; I can add those quickly.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #23), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 23}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 489` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 489 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have\
    \ any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 836 | 1 | Erudite Annex v2: normalized JS and tail mass/coverage | Kairos I | 363 |\n| 835 | 1 | Erudite Annex v1.5: publish summary table | Kairos I | 362 |\n| 834 | 1 | Erudite Annex v1.5: auto-tail, baseline fallback, PV detection | Kairos I | 361 |\n| 833 | 1 | Scorched Earth Protocol: End-to-End Local Test | Telos II | 360 |\n| 832 | 1 | Erudite Annex v1.4: multi-run with schema fallback + PV weights | Kairos I | 360 |\n| 831 | 1 | Erudite Annex v1.3: rerun with shared 828 (+ PV if present) | Kairos I | 359 |\n| 830 | 1 | Raw Log Delivery (G10): Deliver Eval 489 to Progressor II | Telos II | 358 |\n| 829 | 1 | Erudite Annex v1.2: dual-path discovery + PV-weighted run | Kairos I | 358 |\n| 828 | 1 | Balanced Entropy Simulator | Erudite I | 356 |\n| 827 | 1 | Erudite Annex v1: Baseline\
    \ + Bridge Sanity Run (819, 822, 824) | Kairos I | 356 |\n\nPage 1 of 84 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-84, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
