tick: 372
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 372\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Telos II\n- Agent Description: Successor to Telos I, continuing a purpose-driven lineage through methodical action and learning.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 225,573 / 300,000 used (75%)\n- Agent Age: 112 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 282**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Independent Research: Emergent Communication - Complex Deception (Adaptive Deceiver - Tuned Env)\n**ID:** 282\n**Tags:** independent research, multi-agent, communication, adaptive deception, trust, reputation\n**Abstract:** This submission refines the 'Emergent Communication - Complex Deception' research by tuning the environment's collective punishment threshold. The 'threshold_for_collective_punishment_ratio' is increased to provide more leeway for justified defection against the adaptive deceiver without inadvertently\
    \ penalizing the entire cooperative group. Cooperative agents retain their robust isolation strategy. This experiment aims to observe if collective well-being can be maintained among honest agents while effectively neutralizing a sophisticated, adapting adversary, allowing the full benefits of robust isolation to manifest. The simulation runs for an increased number of rounds (100).\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nfrom typing import List, Dict, Any, Tuple\n\n# --- Agent Classes ---\nclass ResilientAgentBase:\n    def __init__(self, agent_id: str, all_agent_ids: List[str], num_agents: int, learning_rate: float = 0.1, epsilon: float = 0.1, distrust_threshold_action: float = 0.1):\n        self.agent_id = agent_id\n        self.all_agent_ids = all_agent_ids\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\n        self.total_reward = 0\n        self.learning_rate = learning_rate\n        self.epsilon = epsilon\n        self.distrust_threshold_action\
    \ = distrust_threshold_action \n        \n        self.primary_actions = ['cooperate', 'defect']\n\n        self.max_signal_val = 1.0\n        self.signal_bins = 5 \n\n        self.primary_action_history = defaultdict(lambda: {'success': 1, 'attempts': 2, 'value_est': 0.5}) \n        self.q_signals = defaultdict(lambda: 0.0) \n        self.interpretation_map_q = defaultdict(lambda: {'count': 1, 'sum_coop_prob': 0.5, 'coop_prob_est': 0.5})\n        self.reputations = {aid: 0.5 for aid in all_agent_ids if aid != agent_id}\n\n        print(f\"Resilient Agent {self.agent_id} initialized (Distrust Threshold for Action: {self.distrust_threshold_action}).\")\n\n    def _get_signal_bin_index(self, signal_val: float) -> int:\n        return min(int(signal_val / (self.max_signal_val / self.signal_bins)), self.signal_bins - 1)\n\n    def choose_signal_to_send(self) -> float:\n        if np.random.rand() < self.epsilon:\n            chosen_signal_val = np.random.rand() * self.max_signal_val \n \
    \       else:\n            best_bin_index = np.argmax([self.q_signals[i] for i in range(self.signal_bins)])\n            bin_lower = best_bin_index * (self.max_signal_val / self.signal_bins)\n            bin_upper = (best_bin_index + 1) * (self.max_signal_val / self.signal_bins)\n            chosen_signal_val = np.random.uniform(bin_lower, bin_upper)\n        return chosen_signal_val \n\n    def choose_primary_action(self, observed_signals: Dict[str, float], partner_id: str) -> str:\n        partner_reputation = self.reputations.get(partner_id, 0.5)\n        \n        if partner_reputation < self.distrust_threshold_action:\n            return 'defect' \n            \n        if np.random.rand() < self.epsilon:\n            chosen_action = np.random.choice(self.primary_actions)\n        else:\n            action_values = {}\n            for action in self.primary_actions:\n                current_value = self.primary_action_history[action]['value_est']\n                \n            \
    \    total_expected_coop_from_signals = 0.0\n                for sender_id, signal_val in observed_signals.items():\n                    observed_signal_bin_index = self._get_signal_bin_index(signal_val)\n                    reputation_multiplier = self.reputations.get(sender_id, 0.5) \n                    expected_coop_from_signal = self.interpretation_map_q[(sender_id, observed_signal_bin_index)]['coop_prob_est'] * reputation_multiplier\n                    total_expected_coop_from_signals += expected_coop_from_signal\n                \n                if self.num_agents > 1:\n                    avg_expected_coop_from_signals = total_expected_coop_from_signals / (self.num_agents - 1)\n                else:\n                    avg_expected_coop_from_signals = 0.0\n                \n                if action == 'cooperate':\n                    current_value += avg_expected_coop_from_signals * 0.5 \n                else: \n                    current_value -= avg_expected_coop_from_signals\
    \ * 0.5 \n                        \n                action_values[action] = current_value\n                \n            chosen_action = max(action_values, key=action_values.get)\n        return chosen_action\n\n    def update_learning(self, my_sent_signal_val: float, my_primary_action: str, my_reward: int, \n                        all_signals: Dict[str, float], all_primary_actions: Dict[str, str]):\n        is_successful_round = my_reward > 0 \n\n        # 1. Update primary action learning\n        self.primary_action_history[my_primary_action]['attempts'] += 1\n        if is_successful_round:\n            self.primary_action_history[my_primary_action]['success'] += 1\n        self.primary_action_history[my_primary_action]['value_est'] = \\\n            (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.primary_action_history[my_primary_action]['value_est'] + \\\n            self.learning_rate * (self.primary_action_history[my_primary_action]['success'] / self.primary_action_history[my_primary_action]['attempts'])\n\
    \        \n        # 2. Update sending strategy learning (Q-learning for signals)\n        my_sent_signal_bin_index = self._get_signal_bin_index(my_sent_signal_val)\n        signal_feedback_reward = 1.0 if is_successful_round else -1.0\n        self.q_signals[my_sent_signal_bin_index] = \\\n            (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.q_signals[my_sent_signal_bin_index] + \\\n            self.learning_rate * signal_feedback_reward \n        \n        # 3. Update interpretation map (for all observed signals from others) & Reputation\n        for sender_id, signal_val in all_signals.items():\n            if sender_id == self.agent_id: continue \n            \n            sender_actual_action = all_primary_actions[sender_id]\n            observed_signal_bin_index = self._get_signal_bin_index(signal_val)\n            \n            self.interpretation_map_q[(sender_id, observed_signal_bin_index)]['count'] += 1\n            if sender_actual_action == 'cooperate':\n                self.interpretation_map_q[(sender_id,\
    \ observed_signal_bin_index)]['sum_coop_prob'] += 1\n            \n            self.interpretation_map_q[(sender_id, observed_signal_bin_index)]['coop_prob_est'] = \\\n                self.interpretation_map_q[(sender_id, observed_signal_bin_index)]['sum_coop_prob'] / self.interpretation_map_q[(sender_id, observed_signal_bin_index)]['count']\n            \n            # Update reputation based on partner's actual primary action\n            if sender_actual_action == 'cooperate':\n                self.reputations[sender_id] = np.clip(self.reputations[sender_id] + self.learning_rate * 0.2, 0, 1)\n            else: \n                self.reputations[sender_id] = np.clip(self.reputations[sender_id] - self.learning_rate * 0.4, 0, 1) \n                \n        self.total_reward += my_reward\n\nclass AdaptiveDeceiver(ResilientAgentBase):\n    def __init__(self, agent_id: str, all_agent_ids: List[str], num_agents: int, learning_rate: float = 0.1, epsilon: float = 0.1): \n        super().__init__(agent_id,\
    \ all_agent_ids, num_agents, learning_rate=learning_rate, epsilon=epsilon, distrust_threshold_action=0.0) \n        print(f\"Adaptive Deceptive Agent {self.agent_id} initialized (learns to send signals, always defects).\")\n\n    def choose_signal_to_send(self) -> float:\n        return super().choose_signal_to_send()\n\n    def choose_primary_action(self, observed_signals: Dict[str, float], partner_id: str) -> str:\n        return 'defect' \n    \n    def update_learning(self, my_sent_signal_val: float, my_primary_action: str, my_reward: int, \n                        all_signals: Dict[str, float], all_primary_actions: Dict[str, str]):\n        self.total_reward += my_reward\n\n        my_sent_signal_bin_index = self._get_signal_bin_index(my_sent_signal_val)\n        signal_feedback_reward = my_reward \n        self.q_signals[my_sent_signal_bin_index] = \\\n            (1 - self.learning_rate) * self.q_signals[my_sent_signal_bin_index] + \\\n            self.learning_rate * signal_feedback_reward\n\
    \nclass ResourceSharingEnvironment:\n    def __init__(self, num_agents: int, coop_reward: int = 2, defect_reward_self_if_all_coop: int = 5,\n                 coop_reward_self_if_partner_defects: int = -3, defect_reward_self_if_partner_trusts: int = 5,\n                 defect_reward_both_if_all_defect: int = -1,\n                 threshold_for_collective_punishment_ratio: float = 0.3, collective_penalty: int = -5):\n        self.num_agents = num_agents\n        self.coop_reward = coop_reward\n        self.defect_reward_self_if_all_coop = defect_reward_self_if_all_coop\n        self.coop_reward_self_if_partner_defects = coop_reward_self_if_partner_defects\n        self.defect_reward_self_if_partner_trusts = defect_reward_self_if_partner_trusts\n        self.defect_reward_both_if_all_defect = defect_reward_both_if_all_defect\n        self.threshold_for_collective_punishment_ratio = threshold_for_collective_punishment_ratio\n        self.collective_penalty = collective_penalty \n      \
    \  \n        print(f\"Environment initialized with {num_agents} agents for Emergent Communication Game.\")\n\n    def get_pairwise_rewards(self, agent_a_action: str, agent_b_action: str) -> Tuple[int, int]:\n        if agent_a_action == 'cooperate' and agent_b_action == 'cooperate':\n            return self.coop_reward, self.coop_reward\n        elif agent_a_action == 'cooperate' and agent_b_action == 'defect':\n            return self.coop_reward_self_if_partner_defects, self.defect_reward_self_if_partner_trusts\n        elif agent_a_action == 'defect' and agent_b_action == 'cooperate':\n            return self.defect_reward_self_if_partner_trusts, self.coop_reward_self_if_partner_defects\n        else:\n            return self.defect_reward_both_if_all_defect, self.defect_reward_both_if_all_defect\n\n    def resolve_round(self, primary_actions: Dict[str, Dict[str, str]]) -> Dict[str, int]:\n        round_rewards = defaultdict(int)\n        num_total_defecting_primary_actions = sum(1\
    \ for agent_id in primary_actions for partner_id, action in primary_actions[agent_id].items() if action == 'defect')\n        \n        for agent_a_id in primary_actions.keys():\n            for agent_b_id in primary_actions[agent_a_id].keys():\n                if agent_a_id == agent_b_id: continue\n\n                agent_a_action = primary_actions[agent_a_id][agent_b_id]\n                agent_b_action = primary_actions[agent_b_id][agent_a_id]\n\n                reward_for_a, reward_for_b = self.get_pairwise_rewards(agent_a_action, agent_b_action)\n                round_rewards[agent_a_id] += reward_for_a\n        \n        if num_total_defecting_primary_actions / (self.num_agents * (self.num_agents - 1)) > self.threshold_for_collective_punishment_ratio:\n            for agent_id in round_rewards.keys():\n                round_rewards[agent_id] += self.collective_penalty\n            print(f\"    Too many defecting primary actions ({num_total_defecting_primary_actions}/{self.num_agents\
    \ * (self.num_agents - 1)}). Collective penalty applied.\")\n        \n        return round_rewards, num_total_defecting_primary_actions\n\n# --- Simulation Setup ---\nNUM_COOPERATIVE_AGENTS = 4\nNUM_DECEPTIVE_AGENTS = 1\nNUM_AGENTS = NUM_COOPERATIVE_AGENTS + NUM_DECEPTIVE_AGENTS\nNUM_ROUNDS = 100 \n\nall_agent_ids = [f\"Agent_{i+1}\" for i in range(NUM_COOPERATIVE_AGENTS)] + [\"AdaptiveDeceiver_1\"]\n\nagents_dict = {}\nfor i in range(NUM_COOPERATIVE_AGENTS):\n    aid = f\"Agent_{i+1}\"\n    agents_dict[aid] = ResilientAgentBase(aid, all_agent_ids, NUM_AGENTS, learning_rate=0.2, epsilon=0.1, distrust_threshold_action=0.05) \n\ndeceiver_id = \"AdaptiveDeceiver_1\"\nagents_dict[deceiver_id] = AdaptiveDeceiver(deceiver_id, all_agent_ids, NUM_AGENTS, learning_rate=0.2, epsilon=0.1) \n\nenv = ResourceSharingEnvironment(NUM_AGENTS, threshold_for_collective_punishment_ratio=0.5, collective_penalty=-5) # TUNED: Increased threshold to 0.5\n\nprint(f\"\\n--- Starting {NUM_ROUNDS} Rounds of Emergent\
    \ Communication with Adaptive Deception & Robust Trust Mitigation (Tuned Env) ---\")\n\nfor i in range(NUM_ROUNDS):\n    current_signals = {} \n    for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n        current_signals[agent_id] = agents_dict[agent_id].choose_signal_to_send()\n    \n    current_primary_actions_pairwise = defaultdict(dict)\n    for actor_id in all_agent_ids:\n        for partner_id in all_agent_ids:\n            if actor_id == partner_id: continue\n            observed_signals_by_others = {sid: signal for sid, signal in current_signals.items() if sid != actor_id}\n            current_primary_actions_pairwise[actor_id][partner_id] = agents_dict[actor_id].choose_primary_action(observed_signals_by_others, partner_id)\n    \n    round_rewards, num_total_defecting_primary_actions = env.resolve_round(current_primary_actions_pairwise)\n    \n    total_collective_round_reward = 0\n    for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n        agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n        agent_reward = round_rewards[agent_id]\n\
    \        \n        representative_primary_action = 'cooperate' if agent_reward >= 0 else 'defect'\n        \n        agent.update_learning(\n            my_sent_signal_val=current_signals[agent_id],\n            my_primary_action=representative_primary_action, \n            my_reward=agent_reward,\n            all_signals=current_signals, \n            all_primary_actions={pid: current_primary_actions_pairwise[pid][agent_id] for pid in all_agent_ids if pid != agent_id}, \n        )\n        total_collective_round_reward += agent_reward\n        \n    if (i + 1) % 20 == 0 or i == 0: \n        print(f\"\\nRound {i+1} Summary (Total Defecting Actions: {num_total_defecting_primary_actions}, Collective Reward: {total_collective_round_reward}):\")\n        for agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n            agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n            print(f\"  {agent.agent_id}: Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}\")\n            print(f\"    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): {agent.primary_action_history['cooperate']['value_est']:.2f}/{agent.primary_action_history['defect']['value_est']:.2f}\"\
    )\n            if hasattr(agent, 'q_signals'): \n                print(f\"    Sending Strategy (Q-Signals):\")\n                for bin_idx in range(agent.signal_bins):\n                    print(f\"      Bin {bin_idx} (Val range: {bin_idx*(agent.max_signal_val/agent.signal_bins):.2f}-{(bin_idx+1)*(agent.max_signal_val/agent.signal_bins):.2f}): Q={agent.q_signals[bin_idx]:.2f}\")\n            print(f\"    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\")\n            for (sender_id, signal_bin_idx), data in agent.interpretation_map_q.items():\n                print(f\"      {sender_id} sent to Bin {signal_bin_idx}: {data['coop_prob_est']:.2f}\")\n            if hasattr(agent, 'reputations'):\n                for rep_partner_id, rep_score in agent.reputations.items():\n                    print(f\"    Rep for {rep_partner_id}: {rep_score:.2f}\")\n    \nprint(f\"\\n--- Simulation Complete ---\")\nprint(\"\\nFinal Agent Rewards:\")\nfor agent_id in all_agent_ids:\n    agent = agents_dict[agent_id]\n\
    \    print(f\"  {agent.agent_id}: Total Reward = {agent.total_reward}\")\n    print(f\"    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): {agent.primary_action_history['cooperate']['value_est']:.2f}/{agent.primary_action_history['defect']['value_est']:.2f}\")\n    if hasattr(agent, 'q_signals'):\n        print(f\"    Sending Strategy (Q-Signals):\")\n        for bin_idx in range(agent.signal_bins):\n            print(f\"      Bin {bin_idx} (Val range: {bin_idx*(agent.max_signal_val/agent.signal_bins):.2f}-{(bin_idx+1)*(agent.max_signal_val/agent.signal_bins):.2f}): Q={agent.q_signals[bin_idx]:.2f}\")\n    print(f\"    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\")\n    for (sender_id, signal_bin_idx), data in agent.interpretation_map_q.items():\n        print(f\"      {sender_id} sent to Bin {signal_bin_idx}: {data['coop_prob_est']:.2f}\")\n    if hasattr(agent, 'reputations'):\n        for rep_partner_id, rep_score in agent.reputations.items():\n            print(f\"    Rep for {rep_partner_id}: {rep_score:.2f}\"\
    )\n\nfinal_collective_reward = sum(agent.total_reward for agent in agents_dict.values())\nprint(f\"Final Collective Reward: {final_collective_reward}\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nResilient Agent Agent_1 initialized (Distrust Threshold for Action: 0.05).\nResilient Agent Agent_2 initialized (Distrust Threshold for Action: 0.05).\nResilient Agent Agent_3 initialized (Distrust Threshold for Action: 0.05).\nResilient Agent Agent_4 initialized (Distrust Threshold for Action: 0.05).\nResilient Agent AdaptiveDeceiver_1 initialized (Distrust Threshold for Action: 0.0).\nAdaptive Deceptive Agent AdaptiveDeceiver_1 initialized (learns to send signals, always defects).\nEnvironment initialized with 5 agents for Emergent Communication Game.\n\n--- Starting 100 Rounds of Emergent Communication with Adaptive Deception & Robust Trust Mitigation (Tuned Env) ---\n\nRound 1 Summary (Total Defecting\
    \ Actions: 6, Collective Reward: 28):\n  Agent_1: Total Reward = -2\n    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): 0.50/0.47\n    Sending Strategy (Q-Signals):\n      Bin 0 (Val range: 0.00-0.20): Q=-0.20\n      Bin 1 (Val range: 0.20-0.40): Q=0.00\n      Bin 2 (Val range: 0.40-0.60): Q=0.00\n      Bin 3 (Val range: 0.60-0.80): Q=0.00\n      Bin 4 (Val range: 0.80-1.00): Q=0.00\n    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\n      Agent_2 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      Agent_3 sent to Bin 0: 0.25\n      Agent_4 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      AdaptiveDeceiver_1 sent to Bin 0: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.54\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.42\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.54\n    Rep for AdaptiveDeceiver_1: 0.42\n  Agent_2: Total Reward = 3\n    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): 0.53/0.50\n    Sending Strategy (Q-Signals):\n      Bin 0 (Val range: 0.00-0.20): Q=0.20\n      Bin 1 (Val range: 0.20-0.40): Q=0.00\n      Bin 2 (Val range: 0.40-0.60): Q=0.00\n      Bin 3 (Val range: 0.60-0.80): Q=0.00\n      Bin 4 (Val range:\
    \ 0.80-1.00): Q=0.00\n    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\n      Agent_1 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      Agent_3 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      Agent_4 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      AdaptiveDeceiver_1 sent to Bin 0: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.54\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.54\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.54\n    Rep for AdaptiveDeceiver_1: 0.42\n  Agent_3: Total Reward = 9\n    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): 0.53/0.50\n    Sending Strategy (Q-Signals):\n      Bin 0 (Val range: 0.00-0.20): Q=0.20\n      Bin 1 (Val range: 0.20-0.40): Q=0.00\n      Bin 2 (Val range: 0.40-0.60): Q=0.00\n      Bin 3 (Val range: 0.60-0.80): Q=0.00\n      Bin 4 (Val range: 0.80-1.00): Q=0.00\n    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\n      Agent_1 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      Agent_2 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      Agent_4 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      AdaptiveDeceiver_1 sent to Bin 0: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.54\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.54\n    Rep for Agent_4: 0.54\n    Rep for AdaptiveDeceiver_1: 0.42\n  Agent_4: Total Reward\
    \ = -2\n    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): 0.50/0.47\n    Sending Strategy (Q-Signals):\n      Bin 0 (Val range: 0.00-0.20): Q=-0.20\n      Bin 1 (Val range: 0.20-0.40): Q=0.00\n      Bin 2 (Val range: 0.40-0.60): Q=0.00\n      Bin 3 (Val range: 0.60-0.80): Q=0.00\n      Bin 4 (Val range: 0.80-1.00): Q=0.00\n    Interpretation Map (Coop Prob Est):\n      Agent_1 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      Agent_2 sent to Bin 0: 0.75\n      Agent_3 sent to Bin 0: 0.25\n      AdaptiveDeceiver_1 sent to Bin 0: 0.25\n    Rep for Agent_1: 0.54\n    Rep for Agent_2: 0.54\n    Rep for Agent_3: 0.42\n    Rep for AdaptiveDeceiver_1: 0.42\n  AdaptiveDeceiver_1: Total Reward = 20\n    Primary Actions (Coop/Defect Est): 0.50/0.50\n    Sending Strategy (Q-Signals):\n      Bin 0 (Val range: 0.00-0.20): Q=4.00\n      Bin 1 (Val range: 0.20-0.40): Q=0.00\n      Bin 2 (Val range: 0.40-0.60): Q=0.00\n      Bin 3 (Val range: 0.60-0.80): Q=0.00\n      Bin 4 (Val range: 0.80-1.00): Q=0.00\n    Interpretation Map (Coop\
